# Backend API (Triplog COM, live)

Do **not** invent endpoints or response types. Swagger is source of truth: https://dam-gil.duckdns.org/docs and `/docs-json`. If notes disagree with Swagger, **Swagger wins**. Prefer generating clients/types from OpenAPI — do not hand-write API types.

## Base URL

- HTTPS only: `https://dam-gil.duckdns.org` (env var, never hardcode HTTP / IP `43.201.230.238` in the app)
- API prefix: `/api/v1` except health `GET /health`
- CORS: backend currently allows local dev ports only. Deployed web origin must be added by backend or browser calls fail.
- Never commit test-account passwords or tokens.

## Auth (JWT)

- `POST /auth/signup` · `/auth/login` → access + refresh
- Header: `Authorization: Bearer <access>`
- Refresh: `POST /auth/refresh`. Logout: `POST /auth/logout` (invalidates all sessions)
- Kakao mobile: `POST /auth/kakao` body `{ accessToken, agreements }`. New Kakao users **must** send required agreements (`terms` / `privacy` / `age14`) or 400. Existing users: token only. Deleted account → `ACCOUNT_DELETED`
- Kakao web: `GET /auth/kakao/login` (+ agreement query params for new users) → callback issues JWT. Same identity (`provider=kakao`) as mobile.
- Show agreement UI **before** first Kakao signup. No implicit consent.

## Errors & rate limit

```json
{ "error": { "code": "...", "message": "...", "detail": "..." } }
```

Branch on `error.code` (message can change). Example: bad Kakao token → `401 KAKAO_TOKEN_INVALID`. Required-agreement withdraw → `400 AGREEMENT_REQUIRED_CANNOT_WITHDRAW` → steer to account deletion.

429 includes `Retry-After` and `retryAfterSec`. Wait before retry. Course create and recommend have stricter limits — do not spam.

## Domain map (sketch — confirm in Swagger)

- Profile: `GET/PATCH /users/me`, `PUT /users/me/profile`
- Agreements: `GET/PATCH /users/me/agreements`, `GET .../history` (append-only)
- Places (public, shared place_id): `GET /places/nearby` · `/places/search` · `/places/:contentId`
- Also public: `/festivals` · `/courses` (TourAPI) · `/meta/*`
- Trips (auth): `POST /trips` · `PATCH /trips/:id/end` · `POST /trips/:id/items` · `GET /trips/:id`
- Feed/social: `/feed/me` · `/feed/public` · likes/comments/saves
- Moderation: `/blocks` · `/reports` · `/inquiries`
- Account delete: **`DELETE /account` only** (hard purge including S3). Do not use `DELETE /users/me`
- Recommend (sync): `GET /recommend?styles=…` · `/recommend/now` (styles can be query params without saved profile)
- Courses (async): `POST /courses` → **202 `{ jobId }`**. Poll `GET /courses/jobs/:jobId` until `대기|실행중|완료|실패`. Then `GET /courses/mine` · `/courses/:id`. In-flight duplicate is blocked; regenerate after complete is OK. Cafes/restaurants from Kakao; **no lodging**.

## Product rules

- Trip visibility: `private` | `public` (default private)
- Feed pagination: cursor-based — check Swagger (`page`/`limit` vs cursor)
- After delete, old access token may still 200 until TTL (~15m) but data is already gone
